# Illusion spell names + descriptions.
spell-minor_illusion = Minor Illusion
spell-minor_illusion-desc = Weave the shape of a small object into a spot right beside you. The conjured trickery holds for a few minutes, until it fades or you summon another in its place.
spell-silent_image = Silent Image
spell-silent_image-desc = You conjure a purely visual mirage of an object, creature, or scene no larger than a few paces across. It makes no sound, smell, or sensation and can be revealed for the trick it is by careful inspection.
spell-major_image = Major Image
spell-major_image-desc = The caster conjures a vivid, lifelike phantom of an object, creature, or scene up to a large cube.
spell-project_image = Project Image
spell-project_image-desc = The caster conjures a perfect illusory double of themselves nearby. The phantom holds its shape until a doubter's blow scatters it.
spell-disguise_self = Disguise Self
spell-disguise_self-desc = The caster wraps themselves in a shimmer of woven glamour, changing how their face, build, and garments appear to onlookers. The disguise holds until dismissed or the magic fades, though a careful touch reveals the truth.
spell-seeming = Seeming
spell-seeming-desc = The caster drapes any number of willing creatures within reach in a woven veil of false form, reshaping how each one appears to onlookers.
spell-magic_aura = Magic Aura
spell-magic_aura-desc = By cloaking yourself in a subtle veil, you feed false readings to those who probe you with detection magic. The deception masks your true nature or invents one that was never there.
spell-color_spray = Color Spray
spell-color_spray-desc = A sudden fan of dazzling, shifting hues erupts from your outstretched hand. Anyone caught in the cone is overwhelmed by the swirling colors, left blinking and blind.
spell-blur = Blur
spell-blur-desc = Your outline shivers and smears into a wavering double-image, so foes relying on sight strike at the blur and land their blows less often.
spell-fey_mischief = Fey Mischief
spell-fey_mischief-desc = You saturate a chosen cube of space with capricious fey glamour. Creatures caught within find their eyes dazzled and their sight unreliable, unable to shake off the confusion.
spell-invisibility = Invisibility
spell-invisibility-desc = You bend light and muffle sound around yourself until you fade almost entirely from notice, moving unseen by all but the keenest senses.
spell-mirror_image = Mirror Image
spell-mirror_image-desc = Flickering duplicates of yourself spring into being and weave around you in step, so a foe can never be sure which figure is flesh. Each strike that lands on a decoy shatters it harmlessly.
spell-phantasmal_force = Phantasmal Force
spell-phantasmal_force-desc = You plant a convincing false vision in a single mind, and the victim's own belief in the phantom turns it against them, gnawing at their thoughts with wounds no one else can see.
spell-fear = Fear
spell-fear-desc = You unfurl a cone of phantasmal dread, conjuring each victim's deepest terror before their eyes. Those who fail to steel their will recoil in panic, striking far less surely while the fright holds.
spell-hypnotic_pattern = Hypnotic Pattern
spell-hypnotic_pattern-desc = A shimmering lattice of shifting colors blooms in the air, snaring the minds of all who glimpse it. Those caught in the weave stand entranced and defenseless until roused or the spell fades.
